40
00:02:07.283 --> 00:02:31.816
Malis writes about people in her town. A bus driver is someone who takes us to school. A builder is a person who builds houses. A fisherman catches fish in the Tonle Sap. A potter makes pots from clay. A designer makes new things look beautiful. A musician plays at weddings. A volunteer worker helps without money. And an explorer discovers new places!

